<v Ira Glass>[鸣谢]

00:57:46.220 --> 00:57:50.630
<v Ira Glass>You know you can download audio of our program an audible.com/thisamericanlife.
<v Ira Glass>你知道你可以在 audible.com/thisamericanlife 下载我们节目的音频。

