<v Ira Glass>《此生美国》由国际公共广播电台（Public Radio International）发行。

00:58:17.560 --> 00:58:24.650
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who calls me into his office every day, lowers the lights, and reminds me--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督由托雷·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）负责，他每天把我叫进他的办公室，调暗灯光，并提醒我——

00:58:24.650 --> 00:58:30.770
<v Rick Cowen>Calling the cops in this business is a death sentence. It's just not done.
<v Rick Cowen>在这个行业里报警等于判死刑。根本没人这么干。

00:58:30.770 --> 00:58:55.720
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带著更多《此生美国》的故事回归。

